lse LM | Map precision | Coverage | Sim time [s] | x real time |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1. Known landmarks only | PASS | 0.031 | 0.124 | 0.92 | 60/113 | 0 | 0.99 | 0.75 | 33.6 | 3.02 |\n| 2. Unknown landmarks only | PASS | 0.314 | 0.330 | 1.10 | 0/183 | 0 | 0.86 | 0.75 | 32.8 | 2.96 |\n| 3. Mixed known and unknown landmarks | PASS | 0.302 | 0.327 | 2.82 | 12/161 | 0 | 0.86 | 0.74 | 31.9 | 3.13 |\n| 4. Completely unknown environment | FAIL | 3.425 | 3.424 | 6.52 | 0/220 | 0 | 0.90 | 0.93 | 112.3 | 2.49 |\n| 5. Noisy IMU | PASS | 0.244 | 0.363 | 2.22 | 12/200 | 0 | 0.89 | 0.77 | 42.5 | 2.88 |\n| 6. Noisy LiDAR | PASS | 0.085 | 0.178 | 0.88 | 12/176 | 0 | 0.95 | 0.76 | 31.7 | 2.87 |\n| 7. Camera feature loss | PASS | 0.981 | 0.999 | 1.85 | 12/168 | 0 | 0.97 | 0.76 | 42.3 | 3.35 |\n| 8. GNSS unavailable | PASS | 0.035 | 0.239 | 0.80 | 12/173 | 0 | 1.00 | 0.74 | 43.6 | 2.78 |\n| 9. Landmark occlusion | FAIL | 0.577 | 0.630 | 1.23 | 12/208 | 0 | 0.99 | 0.65 | 150.0 | 2.10 |\n| 10. Loop closure | FAIL | 0.503 | 0.682 | 2.46 | 0/164 | 0 | 0.89 | 0.56 | 160.0 | 0.11 |\n| 11. Dynamic obstacles | PASS | 0.049 | 0.396 | 1.03 | 12/208 | 0 | 0.97 | 0.78 | 42.5 | 2.80 |\n| 12. Autonomous exploration | FAIL | 0.483 | 0.612 | 0.88 | 12/208 | 0 | 0.86 | 0.64 | 135.5 | 2.62 |\n| 13. Differential-flatness trajectory tracking | PASS | 0.066 | 0.110 | 0.99 | 0/120 | 0 | 1.00 | 0.89 | 34.8 | 4.35 |\n| 14. LQR tracking under disturbances | PASS | 0.124 | 0.227 | 0.96 | 0/129 | 0 | 1.00 | 0.89 | 43.2 | 3.93 |\n| 15. Localisation recovery after sensor degradation | FAIL | 2.256 | 2.242 | 6.52 | 12/34 | 0 | 0.77 | 0.39 | 15.2 | 3.81 |\n\n## 1. Known landmarks only\nOnly database landmarks (marker ids, prior coordinates). The EKF recognises them and corrects its pose.\n\n- \u2705 position RMSE <= 0.5 m: `0.031`\n- \u2705 no collision: `null`\n- \u2705 goal reached (estimated) and true error < 2.5 m: `{\"state\": \"ARRIVED\", \"true_goal_error_m\": 0.114}`\n- \u2705 >= 3 known landmarks recognised: `17`\n\n## 2. Unknown landmarks only\nNo database. Every landmark is discovered, initialised and tracked by the SLAM front end.\n\n- \u2705 position RMSE <= 0.8 m: `0.314`\n- \u2705 no collision: `null`\n- \u2705 goal reached (estimated) and true error < 2.5 m: `{\"state\": \"ARRIVED\", \"true_goal_error_m\": 0.323}`\n- \u2705 >= 15 landmarks discovered: `183`\n- \u2705 false landmarks <= 0: `0`\n\n## 3. Mixed known and unknown landmarks\nDefault urban map: 12 known (with 0.3 m database error to be corrected) and 260 unknown landmarks.\n\n- \u2705 position RMSE <= 0.8 m: `0.302`\n- \u2705 no collision: `null`\n- \u2705 goal reached (estimated) and true error < 2.5 m: `{\"state\": \"ARRIVED\", \"true_goal_error_m\": 0.366}`\n- \u2705 mean landmark error <= 0.35 m: `0.294`\n\n## 4. Completely unknown environment\nDense obstacles, no database, no GNSS. Map, landmarks and path are all built online.\n\n- \u274c position RMSE <= 1.0 m: `3.425`\n- \u274c no collision: `{\"t\": 112.32749999993409, \"position\": [-5.0893688092220035, 13.19280835491814, 5.297071818526746], \"clearance\": 0.34950375797800903}`\n- \u274c goal reached (estimated) and true error < 2.5 m: `{\"state\": \"LOC_HOLD\", \"true_goal_error_m\": 19.31}`\n- \u2705 map precision >= 0.6: `0.903`\n\n## 5. Noisy IMU\nIMU white noise x5 for the whole flight; the filter's process noise is not retuned.\n\n- \u2705 position RMSE <= 1.2 m: `0.244`\n- \u2705 no collision: `null`\n- \u2705 goal reached (estimated) and true error < 2.5 m: `{\"state\": \"ARRIVED\", \"true_goal_error_m\": 0.686}`\n\n## 6. Noisy LiDAR\nLiDAR range noise x10 (0.2 m) and 20 % dropouts; the map degrades gracefully.\n\n- \u2705 no collision: `null`\n- \u2705 goal reached (estimated) and true error < 2.5 m: `{\"state\": \"ARRIVED\", \"true_goal_error_m\": 0.196}`\n- \u2705 map precision >= 0.5: `0.952`\n\n## 7. Camera feature loss\nCamera blacked out from 8 s to 16 s: IMU + baro dead reckoning, covariance grows