273069842693, 2.3666479199790134], \"clearance\": 0.34877608093527535}`\n- \u2705 free-space coverage >= 0.45: `0.635`\n\n## 13. Differential-flatness trajectory tracking\nAggressive min-snap figure in open space, perfect-weather LQR tracking of the flat outputs.\n\n- \u2705 no collision: `null`\n- \u2705 tracking RMSE <= 0.3 m: `0.11`\n- \u2705 trajectory within v/a/j/s/thrust/tilt limits: `{}`\n\n## 14. LQR tracking under disturbances\nSame figure with 3 m/s wind, 1 m/s gusts and two 4 N impulsive pushes.\n\n- \u2705 no collision: `null`\n- \u2705 tracking RMSE <= 0.5 m: `0.227`\n\n## 15. Localisation recovery after sensor degradation\nCamera blackout 8-18 s plus IMU noise x4 in the same window, then nominal sensors: the error returns to its pre-fault level.\n\n- \u274c no collision: `{\"t\": 15.24249999999911, \"position\": [-15.562400586723074, 0.4869186374349988, 5.397114148700736], \"clearance\": 0.348998606027189}`\n- \u274c error after recovery < error during degradation and < 0.6 m: `{\"err_before\": 0.03660930982918924, \"err_end_of_fault\": NaN, \"err_after\": NaN}`\n- \u2705 mean position NEES < 7.8 (chi2_3 95%): `6.518`\n"}